  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      418.63,
      286.69,
      500.24
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give Notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the land described below to creating a water reserve under Weras Ganga Storm Water Drainage and Environment Improvement Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      501.67,
      286.7,
      600.08
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: An allotment of land in total extent of 0.2297 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9469 dated 19.12.2014 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the village called Bellanthara in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 535A of Bellanwila in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewa in Colombo District of Western Province and described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.8,
      601.52,
      112.44,
      623.4
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      623.63,
      317.8,
      684.08
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Kanuketiya Kumbura; Description: Marshy Land; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mrs. Wickramasinghage Arachchige Sharmen Shiron Perera, No. 116/2C, Piriwena Road, Boralesgamuwa; Extent: 0.2297 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      334.88,
      539.39,
      480.32
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by Agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Sri Lanka Land Reclamation and Development Corporation, No. 03, Sri Jayawardenapura Mawatha, Welikada, Rajagiriya on 08.04.2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 01.04.2015, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      482.94,
      541.08,
      682.64
    ],
